<span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#4A5568;letter-spacing:0.02em;">2027 FHSA room after the opening decision</span>
<span style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#4A5568;">$16,000</span>
<span style="font-size:13px;color:#4A5568;">Unused December opening</span>
<span style="font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-left:auto;">CAD | Standard FHSA rules</span>
</div>
<div style="padding:12px 14px 8px;">
