  '<div class="toolkit-section">
<div class="toolkit-section-label">What They''re Feeling</div>
<p>A first-time buyer can be eligible to open an account while having no cash set aside to fund it this year.</p>
</div>
<div class="toolkit-section">
<div class="toolkit-section-label">What to Say</div>
<div class="script-box">How much could you realistically contribute during 2027? That number tells us whether the earlier opening creates usable capacity.</div>
</div>
<div class="toolkit-section">
<div class="toolkit-section-label">Who''s Affected</div>
