I can share a worksheet that separates transaction counts, average bill and receipts. It can help identify where a change in sales matters for your cash plan.<br><br>
Would you have 15 minutes to talk this week?<br><br>
[Your Name]<br><br>
<em>This communication is for educational purposes only.</em>
</div>
<button class="btn-copy" onclick="copyEmail(''prospect-email'', this)">Copy email</button>
</div>',
  '[{"value":"+$14.46M","label":"Canadian monthly change"},{"value":"−$12.18M","label":"Quebec monthly change"},{"value":"+$26.64M","label":"Rest of Canada, implied"},{"value":"46%","label":"Share of ex-Quebec gain offset"}]',
  'economy-170.jpg',
  'Stacks of plates wait at a stainless-steel restaurant pass.',
  4,
  '2026-11-26T07:34:18',
  'entity:statistics-canada,theme:food-services,theme:regional-spending,stance:base-case',
  1,
